---
source: system/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"lsns\")"
---
List system namespaces

Usage: lsns [OPTIONS] [NAMESPACE]

Arguments:
  [NAMESPACE]  Optional namespace inode to show

Options:
  -J, --json             Use JSON output format
  -l, --list             Use list format output
  -n, --noheadings       Don't print headings
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Output columns to print
      --output-all       Output all columns
  -r, --raw              Use raw output format
  -t, --type <NS_TYPE>   Namespace type filter
  -p, --task <TASK>      Print namespaces for a specific PID
  -h, --help             Print help
